Package: bslibreact
Title: Bootstrap Layout for 'shinyreact' Apps
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Samuel", "Bharti", , "samuelbharti.io@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: R-side helpers for building Shiny apps in the shinyreact
    'ui.tsx' pattern that look like 'bslib' apps. Provides page dependency
    discovery so a client bundle can request the same CSS and JavaScript a
    'bslib' page would attach on its own, and a hosted-input helper for
    widgets rendered server-side and displayed by the client. The matching
    React components live in the 'bslib-react' npm package.
